# Local-only ANALYSIS qualification state. The frozen malware corpus and the
# frozen diagnostics/oracles are transported by hand between machines and must
# never be committed; ignoring them here closes the accidental-`git add` gap
# that MANIFEST.in covers only for sdists. Scope is exactly these three trees —
# other workdir/ subdirectories still hold untracked scratch next to tracked
# fixtures, so `git add -A` remains unsafe (see AGENTS.md).
# workdir/samples/ also holds two TRACKED benign fixtures, so it is ignored by
# content and those two are re-admitted by name rather than ignoring the
# directory. The benign trivial_greeting_demo.js is deliberately left ignored:
# it is untracked and hand-transported like the corpus.
/workdir/samples/*
!/workdir/samples/suspicious_dropper_demo.js
!/workdir/samples/vulnerable_service.py
/workdir/diag/
/workdir/campaign/
